          "name": "Create Default Rule",
          "request": {
            "name": "Create Default Rule",
            "description": {
              "content": "Create a default rule. Default rules are applied universally across existing tasks, subsequently created new tasks, and any non-task related requests. Once a rule is created, it is immutable. Available rules are 'KeywordRule', 'ModelHallucinationRuleV2', 'ModelSensitiveDataRule', 'PIIDataRule', 'PromptInjectionRule', 'RegexRule', 'ToxicityRule'. Note: The rules are cached by the validation endpoints for 60 seconds.",
